nothing you build on them takes a licence from them. The share-alike above
comes from Wikipedia, and none of Wikipedia's text is in these columns. The
first five were written for this project, about this project's own database.
The ten tables' prose was measured field by field against the Wikipedia
articles a writer would have reached for — `docs/prose_pass.tsv`, the prose
pass — and every field in them reads as this project's own expression. The
remaining columns of the tables they sit in — the subject and field of a
